---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/mounts.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- the call: the mount stands beside, following
@1000 conn#4 sends UseItem 1:0
   -> send conn#4 EntitySpawn vid=5 (474850, 966100) kind=8 race=1201 angle=0 speed=180/100
   -> send conn#4 MountState level=1 grade=1 look=1201 stamina=30/30 ride_from=6 fights=false skills=false points=0 summoned=Some(5)
-- getting on: the mount leaves the world, the rider rides at the level's speed and the look's run speed
@1000 conn#4 sends RideMount ride=true
   -> send conn#4 EntityRemove vid=5
   -> send conn#4 EntityMount vid=4 look=1201
   -> send conn#4 EntityUpdate vid=4 parts=[0, 0, 0, 0] speed=180/100 game-master
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 19=180
   -> send conn#4 RunSpeed 800
   -> send conn#4 MountState level=1 grade=1 look=1201 stamina=30/30 ride_from=6 fights=false skills=false points=0 summoned=None
-- ignored: getting off too soon
@1000 conn#4 sends RideMount ride=false
-- getting off: on foot again, the mount beside
@2000 conn#4 sends RideMount ride=false
   -> send conn#4 EntityMount vid=4 look=0
   -> send conn#4 EntityUpdate vid=4 parts=[0, 0, 0, 0] speed=150/100 game-master
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 19=150
   -> send conn#4 RunSpeed 450
   -> send conn#4 EntitySpawn vid=6 (474850, 966100) kind=8 race=1201 angle=0 speed=180/100
   -> send conn#4 MountState level=1 grade=1 look=1201 stamina=30/30 ride_from=6 fights=false skills=false points=0 summoned=Some(6)
-- the call again sends it away; getting on calls it back first
@3000 conn#4 sends UseItem 1:0
   -> send conn#4 EntityRemove vid=6
   -> send conn#4 MountState level=1 grade=1 look=1201 stamina=30/30 ride_from=6 fights=false skills=false points=0 summoned=None
@3000 conn#4 sends RideMount ride=true
   -> send conn#4 EntityMount vid=4 look=1201
   -> send conn#4 EntityUpdate vid=4 parts=[0, 0, 0, 0] speed=180/100 game-master
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 19=180
   -> send conn#4 RunSpeed 800
   -> send conn#4 MountState level=1 grade=1 look=1201 stamina=30/30 ride_from=6 fights=false skills=false points=0 summoned=None
-- the call while riding: off, and the mount goes away
@4000 conn#4 sends UseItem 1:0
   -> send conn#4 EntityMount vid=4 look=0
   -> send conn#4 EntityUpdate vid=4 parts=[0, 0, 0, 0] speed=150/100 game-master
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 19=150
   -> send conn#4 RunSpeed 450
   -> send conn#4 MountState level=1 grade=1 look=1201 stamina=30/30 ride_from=6 fights=false skills=false points=0 summoned=None
